% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: scaled stroke keeps its width. The stroke records the CTM it
% was measured in; the PDF wraps it in that matrix with the path taken
% back through the inverse, so the width of 1 is read in the scaled
% space, as the program set it.
2 2 scale
1 setlinewidth
5 5 moveto 50 5 lineto stroke
showpage
